  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Khao man gai serves 4 and takes about 55 minutes. The chicken is gently poached so it stays silky, and the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "jasmine rice",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "jasmine-rice"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is cooked in the resulting broth with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "garlic",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "garlic"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fresh ginger",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ginger-fresh"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Nothing is wasted and the flavour runs through every component."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not rush the poach. A low, barely simmering liquid gives the tenderest chicken. Boiling makes it tough."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
